silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_02_vetclinic_kg_as_target_category_concrete_anchor#clinicvetrecord silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicVetRecord is the clinic's electronic record (the patient's complete chart in the practice-management system). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ClinicVetRecord', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
